{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774053230,"nonce":"WFzFzl+96g6qYuqgmbLr8cXKUMg=","title":"Partition C: Chat Integration — preset selector, live updates, indicators, PTY banner","message":"All chat/console integration work for Presets:\n\n**NewSessionDialog preset selector** (modify ui/src/components/console/NewSessionDialog.tsx):\n- Pill-style multi-select field for presets\n- Autocomplete popover: search input, filtered list, click/Enter to add\n- Selected presets shown as dismissible pills\n- Drag-to-reorder pills (pill order = composition order)\n- Each pill: nav affordance (small icon) linking to #/presets?id=\u003cpreset-id\u003e + dismiss X\n- New EntityPillType for presets in EntityPill.tsx\n- Default to default_preset_ids setting\n- Empty state: \"Import from CLAUDE.md\" link + \"Create preset\" link\n- Only visible for SDK backend sessions; hidden for PTY\n- Pass presetIds to createConsoleSession API call\n\n**Live preset selector in chat sidebar** (modify ui/src/views/console.tsx):\n- For active SDK sessions: show preset pills in sidebar controls area\n- Add/remove presets mid-conversation\n- On change: recompute union via GET /api/presets/union, PATCH session options with new systemPrompt + settingSources\n- Next user prompt picks up updated content\n\n**\"Start Chat\" + bidirectional navigation**:\n- Button in Presets tab header: opens NewSessionDialog pre-populated with current preset\n- Chat sidebar pills: each links to #/presets?id=\u003cid\u003e via EntityPill nav affordance\n- URL param handling: #/presets?id=\u003cid\u003e auto-selects that preset in sidebar\n\n**Preset provenance in chat history** (modify conversation/history views):\n- Show which presets (with versions) were active during a conversation\n- Badge in conversation header: \"Presets: Base, Project-mandible (v3)\"\n- Query session_presets via console session linkage\n\n**Violation stream callout + inbox** (modify ui/src/components/stream-renderer/):\n- New block type for preset:violation events\n- Rendered as colored callout (orange/red background, centered, no avatar)\n- Shows: \"Workflow issue detected — [agent analyzing...]\" or \"Workflow issue — [view proposed fix]\"\n- Click behavior: if sub-agent running → navigate to sub-agent chat tab; if done → navigate to preset diff view\n- New inbox item type: preset_diff (diff_id, preset_name, description)\n- Inbox rendering: show diff preview, link to Presets tab diff view\n\n**Export/import UI**:\n- In Presets tab sidebar: per-preset \"...\" menu with \"Export as Markdown\" option\n- Triggers GET /api/presets/:id/export, offers download\n- \"Import Preset\" button at bottom of sidebar\n- File picker or paste Markdown, calls POST /api/presets/import\n- Merge-or-replace dialog for name collisions\n\n**Token/context indicator** (new ui/src/components/presets/ContextIndicator.tsx):\n- Shared component with two variants: bar (for chat) and compact (for preset sidebar)\n- Token estimation: ~1 token per 3.5 chars\n- Model-aware context windows lookup (Opus 1M, Sonnet 250K, Haiku 200K, Gemini models)\n- Bar variant: thin 4px horizontal bar, color-coded (green \u003c25%, yellow 25-50%, red \u003e50%), tooltip with exact numbers\n- Compact variant: small text badge \"~2.1K\" with color\n- In Presets tab sidebar: compact badge per preset, union summary at top\n- In Chat tab: bar in session controls area\n- Thresholds: presets \u003e25% of context = warning, \u003e50% = critical\n\n**PTY deprecation banner** (new ui/src/components/console/PtyBanner.tsx):\n- First element in rich-view stream for PTY sessions\n- Orange text (--accent-yellow), centered, no background/border/avatar\n- Text: \"PTY sessions have limited integration with Mandible. For full features (permissions, cost tracking, presets, conversation history), use an SDK agent session instead.\"\n- Only in rich view mode, only for backend_type === pty\n- Scrolls natural